==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|blur|y}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɜːri}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|blurrier|blurriest}}

# {{context|of an image}} Not [[clear]], [[crisp]], or [[focus]]ed; having [[fuzzy]] edges.
#: ''If I take off my glasses, everything close up looks '''blurry'''.''
# {{context|figuratively}} not [[clear]], not with well-defined boundaries.
#: ''It would seem that the line between flirting and sexual harrassment has become quite '''blurry.'''''

====Derived terms====
* [[blurriness]]

